flowchart TD
    A([Teacher signs in]) --> B[Open Exam Builder]
    B --> C[Set title, duration, schedule]
    C --> D{Add problems}
    D --> E[Coding: title, prompt,<br/>language, time/memory limits]
    D --> F[MCQ: options + correct ids]
    D --> G[Written: rubric, max words]
    E --> H[Add test cases<br/>sample vs hidden]
    F --> I[Save problem]
    G --> I
    H --> I
    I --> J{More questions?}
    J -->|yes| D
    J -->|no| K[Assign to classes]
    K --> L{Ready to publish?}
    L -->|no| M[Save as draft]
    L -->|yes, start_time set| N[Publish]
    L -->|yes, start_time missing| O[Reject: 400 set start time]
    M --> P([end])
    N --> P
    O --> C
